    <p>You do not need to know everything. You do not need to become an architect, engineer, or contractor.</p>
    <p>But you should understand the basics:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>what ADU type may fit your property</li>
      <li>what cost factors may apply</li>
      <li>what red flags to watch for</li>
      <li>what questions to ask</li>
      <li>what information to prepare before appointments</li>
    </ul>
