    <a class="cta-link" href="/free-adu-prep-check">Start My Free ADU Property Preview</a>
  </section>

  <section class="reminder">
    <h2>Simple Reminder</h2>
    <p>The cheapest quote is not always the best quote.</p>
    <p>The highest quote is not always the safest quote.</p>
    <p>The best first step is understanding what you are actually comparing.</p>
    <p>Before you call contractors, get prepared.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
